WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.554
N' tun b'a fɛ ka taga Babatou ka sotigiw kunbɛn. O ye tarikiko dɔ lo ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.354
Saan kɛmɛkulu 19nan laban na. Gurunsi dugumɔgɔw be ɲɛnamaya kɛ cogo nɔgɔman na.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.176
Nka, Babatou ka sagadɛgɛw be tɛmɛ yiritu kɔnɔ.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.306
U be cɛɛ dɔw minɛ k'u feere. Minw tun kɛra kasodenw ye, olugu ta berew bɛ tagama ka taga.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:11.778
O cogo la, dugumɔgɔw bɛɛ b'a ɲini k'u yɛrɛ kɔrɔsi. Ni mɔgɔ dɔ be boon sanfɛ, a tɛ bɔ kɛnɛ kan.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:17.398
Fɛɛn buguri! Sotigiw be nana!

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.232
Lɔnnikɛbagaw ka fɔta sera kongowuruw ma.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.782
Mɔgɔ si tɛ boli. Aw bɛɛ ka taga aw sigiyɔrɔw la!

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.120
Musow ni denmisɛnw b'u yɛrɛ dogo kogojanw kɔnɔ.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.984
Mɔgɔw bɛ dingaw sogi, ka o datugu ni yiriborow ye.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.672
O la, kalanw ni biɲɛw labɛnnin lo.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:17.258
Kɛlɛba be nana. Sotigi minw tun be yɛlɛnna so kan, olu y'u ka see sɔrɔ.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.112
Ayiwa, o bɛɛ n'a ta, sow bɛ benna janw le ra.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.624
Sanbɛrɛw be benna ka bɔ boonw kɔnɔ.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.770
Sotigiw be yɛlɛma. Dugumɔgɔw y'u jija.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.240
O loon sufɛ, an be to ka dɔnkili la ko an ye see sɔrɔ.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:38.084
Dugumɔgɔw b'o faamu ka ɲɛ. N'u b'u kelen na, u tɛ se ka foyi sɔrɔ. U ye ɲɔgɔn lajɛn k'u yɛrɛ tanga.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.088
O bɛ ciraden dɔw ci ɲɔgɔn ma, ka jɛn kɛ.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:09.392
Hali bi, mɔgɔ caaman hakili b'o kɛlɛkow la ani minw ma se ka kisi.
